  "html": "<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"-------------jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:132px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:%E4%BB%99%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%B0.jpg\" title=\"仙人水印.jpg (73 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:132px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/c/ce/%E4%BB%99%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%B0.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/132?cb=20251211192835&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"仙人水印.jpg (73 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"仙人水印.jpg\" data-image-key=\"%E4%BB%99%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%B0.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"仙人水印.jpg (73 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"仙人水印.jpg\" data-image-key=\"%E4%BB%99%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%B0.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/c/ce/%E4%BB%99%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%B0.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/132?cb=20251211192835&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】仙人\n</p><p>【初始区域】神社/医院（由剧本规定）\n</p><p>【禁行区域】无\n</p><p>【不安限度】X(见特性)\n</p><p>【属性】 成人·男性\n</p><p>【特性】X為劇本規定的數值。在事件判定之外需要參照該角色的不安限度時，該角色的不安限度視為0。\n</p><p>結算該角色擔任當事人的事件時，該角色可以視為位於本來所在位置順時針相鄰的版圖。\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好5 1L1）將該角色移動至任意版圖或遠方。隨後，復活同一區域任意1具屍體，並在那張卡牌上放置X枚友好指示物。\n</p><p>【感想】　十戒是什么，烧一下\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCac